SUMMARY:Summer Fruits Season in AlUla
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the richness of AlUla's summer harvest at the Al Manshiyah Farmers Market. This vibrant event features a range of locally grown fruit\, including delicious mangoes\, grapes and figs - highlighting AlUla's deep agricultural roots and cultural heritage.
LOCATION:AlManshiyah Farmers Market
